.TH ORO-SERVICE-WORKER-CONTAINER 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:service\-worker/container \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:service\-worker/container'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:service\-worker/container is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBisServiceWorkerAllowed()\fR
Predicate to determine if service workers are allowed
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIboolean\fR
.TP
\fBServiceWorkerContainer (extends EventTarget)\fR
A `ServiceWorkerContainer` implementation that is attached to the global `globalThis.navigator.serviceWorker` object.
.TP
\fBregister(scriptURL, options)\fR
Registers a service worker and returns its registration.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIscriptURL\fR (string \\| URL; required)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (RegistrationOptions; optional; default null)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<ServiceWorkerRegistration>\fR
